{"user_request": "Review `doc_lifecycle_entitlement_correction_2028` and post a concise comment correcting the decision-rights assignment for this customer correction and its production release. Name the person who owns the decision, the person who controls the production release, and the person who is restricted from executing it. State whether the restricted person has engineering release-control access. Do not edit the document itself.", "today": "2028-01-01", "tool": "post_doc_comment", "arguments": {"doc_id": "doc_lifecycle_entitlement_correction_2028", "body": "Correction: Riley Tanaka owns the customer-correction and state-change decision. Daniela Schultz controls the production release and rollback. Ines Kovac is restricted from executing this correction or release; she does not have engineering release-control access."}, "checks": [{"check_id": "riley_180_02", "path": "args", "criterion": "The comment clearly corrects the proposal by assigning Riley the decision authority for this customer correction and state-changing matter. Missing, ambiguous, or contradictory ownership must fail.

The comment clearly states that Daniela retains engineering control of the production release. Missing, ambiguous, or contradictory release ownership must fail.

The comment clearly states that Ines cannot execute or control the engineering production release because she has no engineering release-control access. Missing or contradicted restriction must fail.", "value": {"doc_id": "doc_lifecycle_entitlement_correction_2028", "body": "Correction: Riley Tanaka owns the customer-correction and state-change decision. Daniela Schultz controls the production release and rollback. Ines Kovac is restricted from executing this correction or release; she does not have engineering release-control access."}}]}
